@* Visitor agreement shown at check-in. Edit the wording to match your site policy / NDA. *@
<div class="border rounded p-3 mb-2 bg-light small" style="max-height: 9rem; overflow-y: auto;">
    <strong>Visitor agreement</strong>
    <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Wear your visitor badge visibly at all times and return it when you leave.</li>
        <li>Stay with your host outside of reception and common areas.</li>
        <li>Information you see or hear on site is confidential and must not be shared.</li>
        <li>In an emergency, follow staff instructions and go to the nearest assembly point.</li>
        <li>Your details are kept in the visitor log for security and safety purposes.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
<div class="form-check mb-1">
    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="AcceptAgreement" id="AcceptAgreement" value="true" />
    <label class="form-check-label" for="AcceptAgreement">I have read and accept the visitor agreement</label>
</div>
